{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"da35bbbffb0347171b8add71085547dcaf9ecec439b62774383ada33425994c5","digest":{"component_or_area":"autolander loop — wipChain state machine and FFO guard","key_entities":["infra/autolander/loop.py","wipChain","phase","re_drive_count","change_id","chain_member_ids","tested_shas","verified_at","main","Autosubmit","needs_rebase","submittable"],"problem_keywords":["state machine","serialization","toctou","fast-forward-only","re-drive","hand-back","chain rebasing","concurrent submission","stale tree","autosubmit"],"propositions":["A single in-memory wipChain record must track chain state (change_id, member_ids, tested_shas, verified_at, phase, re_drive_count) to serialize rebasing and prevent concurrent rebase of two changes onto the same HEAD.","FFO TOCTOU guard must re-confirm tested tree submittability immediately before POST /submit; if main advanced or tested SHA changed, reject submission rather than landing stale code.","After main advances or tested SHA changes, wipChain must re-drive (phase→rebasing, rebase, await Verified, re-check) up to N=5 times before giving up.","After N=5 re-drive exhaustion, hand-back via Autosubmit label removal, Gerrit comment naming reason (needs_rebase), and S3 marker write, signaling to land that the change requires manual rebase.","Phase transition state machine must implement exactly the states {selecting, rebasing, awaiting_verified, submitting, idle, paused} with correct guards and side effects for each."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785822515761551211,"uuid":"c9e53bc9-d4f9-4c14-bb98-1796d6d314bc"}